 r←Test_DisplayButtons_004(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;n;buttons;focusHas;parms;btn;text
⍝ Exercise "DisplayButtons" with `onButtonPressed` with all possible variations.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.flag←0
 #.TEMP.⎕FX⊃'r←n OnButtonPressed msg' 'r←flag←1'

 buttons←2 3⍴'PDF' 'HTML' 'XML' 'OK' 'Don''t know' 'Cancel'
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 parms.onButtonPressed←#.TEMP'OnButtonPressed'
 n←parms ∆DisplayButtons'Please select the appropriate action:'buttons
 btn←parms.cancelButton⊃,n.∆buttons  ⍝ The "Cancel" button
 1 ⎕NQ btn'Select'
 →T.GoToTidyUp #.TEMP.flag≠1
 n.∆CloseForm
 #.TEMP.flag←0

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 parms.onButtonPressed←'#.TEMP.OnButtonPressed'
 n←parms ∆DisplayButtons'Please select the appropriate action:'buttons
 btn←parms.cancelButton⊃,n.∆buttons  ⍝ The "Cancel" button
 1 ⎕NQ btn'Select'
 →T.GoToTidyUp #.TEMP.flag≠1
 n.∆CloseForm
 #.TEMP.flag←0

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 parms.onButtonPressed←'OnButtonPressed'
 text←'Please select the appropriate action:'
 n←parms #.TEMP.{⍺ #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateDisplayButtons'Please select the appropriate action:'⍵}buttons
 btn←parms.cancelButton⊃,n.∆buttons  ⍝ The "Cancel" button
 1 ⎕NQ btn'Select'
 →T.GoToTidyUp #.TEMP.flag≠1

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
